[{"id":"953098766558445568","date":1516071428000,"rawContent":"The sad thing is you almost see the lines of code in the Matrix here, but not quite. This woman was not a victim. She did not put his desires or needs above her own. She\u2019s riding the toxic #MeToo virtue signalling fad to win an slam dunk case in the court of PR. https:\/\/t.co\/lT7saSiaFv","userId":3222442128,"media":null,"username":"DannyAlberta77","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":1.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":21,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":1,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":1.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"956407703760351232","date":1516860340000,"rawContent":"I don\u2019t like Patrick Brown. He\u2019s a liberal pretending to be conservative. It\u2019s still absurd his career is ended by the mere accusations of sexual assault that he denies. There\u2019s no standard of proof, just presumption of guilt. #MeToo is a McCarthyist movement. #onpoli","userId":3222442128,"media":null,"username":"DannyAlberta77","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":2.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":21,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":2,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":2.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"956552514148614144","date":1516894865000,"rawContent":"MSM was \u201cmeh\u201d about this. But Brown must be tarred an feathered with no chance to defend himself. Because conservative. Because #MeToo. #onpoli https:\/\/t.co\/h4ndmGtG7v","userId":3222442128,"media":null,"username":"DannyAlberta77","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":21,"sumOfBlueLiv